<resources>
    <!-- ALIVE voice.

         Rules this file is written to:
           - Reclaimed time, never points, coins, XP or levels.
           - "ALIVE couldn\'t verify" never becomes "you failed".
           - Nothing here claims ALIVE knows what the user did inside an app.
           - No emoji, no dingbats, no developer phase labels.
         Keep every status string distinct: PENDING != VERIFIED != REWARDED. -->

    <string name="app_name">ALIVE</string>
    <string name="accessibility_service_description">ALIVE uses this service solely to detect foreground applications to enforce daily screen time limits and prevent bypass.</string>

